WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:00.700
Tonight.

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.134
The war

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:01.701
in Ukraine

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:03.003
is officially being fought

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:04.871
on Russian territory.

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:06.906
Two groups of Russian nationals

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:08.375
aligned with Ukraine

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:09.442
claimed responsibility

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:10.076
for attacks

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:11.945
in Russia's southwestern

00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:13.680
region of Belgorod.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:14.514
At least eight

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:16.683
people were injured in those attacks.

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:17.851
And Russia has accused

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:19.686
the so-called sabotage groups

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:22.522
of crossing over from Ukraine into Russia

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:24.991
to carry out more combat missions.

00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:27.427
Unlike recent attacks on Russian soil,

00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:29.596
Ukraine acknowledged the cross border

00:00:29.596 --> 00:00:30.964
operation, this time

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:33.199
insisting only that the groups acted

00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:35.001
of their own volition.

00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:36.336
But this is notable.

00:00:36.336 --> 00:00:37.904
It's a notable change

00:00:37.904 --> 00:00:38.705
in tune

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:39.773
as Ukrainians

00:00:39.773 --> 00:00:40.807
try to counter

00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:43.209
Russia's claims of victory in Baku,

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:46.012
the site of this war's deadliest battle.

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:47.447
And as intrigue

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:48.948
grows over the death of yet

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:50.283
another Russian official

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:51.584
who died suddenly

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:53.853
after reportedly criticizing the Kremlin.

00:00:54.287 --> 00:00:55.055
CNN's chief

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.056
international anchor

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:58.725
Christiane Amanpour is joining me now.

00:00:59.092 --> 00:00:59.793
And Christiane,

00:00:59.793 --> 00:01:00.860
we're going to get to the death

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:02.162
of that Russian official in a moment.

00:01:02.162 --> 00:01:02.896
But I want to start with

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:04.664
this attacks in Boulevard,

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:06.733
the fact that these groups were able

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:09.869
to get over the border into mainland

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:11.037
Russia and carry out

00:01:11.037 --> 00:01:12.939
these attacks tells you what about

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:13.873
Russia's ability to

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:16.176
police its own boundaries?

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:17.710
Well, it's classic sabotage.

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:19.145
It's classic counter

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:21.481
offensive by insurgents. Right.

00:01:21.948 --> 00:01:23.249
The Ukrainians are not claiming

00:01:23.249 --> 00:01:25.218
that they're part of the Ukrainian army.

00:01:25.218 --> 00:01:26.986
And we've seen several attacks

00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:29.556
inside Russia over the last many months.

00:01:29.556 --> 00:01:30.790
I mean, let's take the drone

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:32.025
attack on the Kremlin.

00:01:32.025 --> 00:01:34.894
I spoke to a former Russian MP

00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:37.730
who defected and went to Ukraine, Illya

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:39.032
Illya Pulmonary

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:40.600
And he told me that he believed

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.902
that was an act of sabotage

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:44.971
by Russian partizans.

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:46.606
In other words, anti-Kremlin

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:48.074
Russian Partizans.

00:01:48.074 --> 00:01:49.642
And there have been a number of attacks.

00:01:49.642 --> 00:01:50.376
There was the

00:01:50.376 --> 00:01:52.345
pro Russian military blogger

00:01:52.345 --> 00:01:54.147
who was killed in Saint Petersburg.

00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:56.483
There was another high official early on

00:01:56.483 --> 00:01:59.052
who was killed in in the Kremlin

00:01:59.052 --> 00:02:01.621
the daughter of a friend of Putin's.

00:02:01.855 --> 00:02:02.422
And this

00:02:02.422 --> 00:02:04.290
clearly is ramping up,

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:06.059
and that is what they're claiming to be.

00:02:06.059 --> 00:02:08.962
anti-Kremlin Russian Partizans

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:10.763
The other part of this,

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:12.265
the Ukrainian government

00:02:12.265 --> 00:02:13.566
sort of acknowledging

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:15.902
some kind of affinity here.

00:02:15.902 --> 00:02:19.172
But also these attackers were carrying

00:02:19.239 --> 00:02:21.608
Ukrainian gear and Ukrainian weaponry.

00:02:21.908 --> 00:02:23.343
Historically in this conflict,

00:02:23.343 --> 00:02:25.545
there's been a concern about escalation

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:26.913
that might cause the war

00:02:26.913 --> 00:02:28.648
to get out of hand.

00:02:28.648 --> 00:02:30.450
Is that concern waning?

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:31.985
I don't know about waning,

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:33.586
but you can tell that the US

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:35.622
government, the Biden administration

00:02:35.622 --> 00:02:36.956
has always invoked

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:38.591
the slogan World War Three

00:02:38.591 --> 00:02:40.093
I'm not going to do anything,

00:02:40.093 --> 00:02:40.426
you know,

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:42.128
that's going to lead to World War Three.

00:02:42.128 --> 00:02:43.396
And most particularly,

00:02:43.396 --> 00:02:44.731
they started by saying, well,

00:02:44.731 --> 00:02:45.465
we're not going to give

00:02:45.465 --> 00:02:47.167
long range missiles to the Ukrainians

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:48.334
because we don't want it to,

00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:48.601
you know,

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:50.236
we don't want them to attack inside

00:02:50.236 --> 00:02:52.438
Russia with any of the weaponry

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:53.673
that Naito gives.

00:02:53.673 --> 00:02:56.809
And you've seen as the war has progressed

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:59.078
and as the battlefield changes

00:02:59.078 --> 00:03:00.346
NATO's most particularly

00:03:00.346 --> 00:03:02.715
the United States upped the ante

00:03:02.715 --> 00:03:04.784
in terms of what weaponry they're giving.

00:03:04.784 --> 00:03:06.886
So first it was no, no, no, on,

00:03:06.886 --> 00:03:08.288
you know, on long range missiles

00:03:08.288 --> 00:03:09.622
then it was and then they got them.

00:03:09.622 --> 00:03:10.323
Then it was no, no,

00:03:10.323 --> 00:03:12.692
no on the anti-aircraft defense.

00:03:12.692 --> 00:03:13.793
And then they got the Patriots

00:03:13.793 --> 00:03:14.594
and then it was no, no,

00:03:14.594 --> 00:03:16.396
no on the fighter jets.

00:03:16.396 --> 00:03:18.164
And now the US this weekend

00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:20.066
they're going to get the training.

00:03:20.066 --> 00:03:20.700
And the U.S.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:22.468
apparently is waiving

00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:23.703
any sort of prohibition

00:03:23.703 --> 00:03:25.772
on its allies, giving

00:03:25.772 --> 00:03:27.307
Ukraine those fighter jets.

00:03:27.307 --> 00:03:28.441
It's very important

00:03:28.441 --> 00:03:30.476
and that if the United States

00:03:30.476 --> 00:03:32.745
policy is for Ukraine to win,

00:03:32.745 --> 00:03:34.347
which it keeps saying that,

00:03:34.347 --> 00:03:35.181
then they need

00:03:35.181 --> 00:03:37.116
the actual weaponry to do it.

00:03:37.116 --> 00:03:37.517
And even

00:03:37.517 --> 00:03:39.652
I spoke to one of the top generals,

00:03:39.652 --> 00:03:40.620
you know, a year ago,

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:42.722
a year ago in April,

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:43.723
and they said what we need

00:03:43.723 --> 00:03:45.325
is anti-aircraft defense.

00:03:45.325 --> 00:03:46.526
We need long range missiles

00:03:46.526 --> 00:03:47.827
and we need aircraft

00:03:47.827 --> 00:03:48.661
as well as all the other

00:03:48.661 --> 00:03:50.230
things, ammunition and everything.

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:51.164
And you saw

00:03:51.164 --> 00:03:52.131
the Ukrainian president

00:03:52.131 --> 00:03:54.200
Zelensky pressing that case

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:55.602
at the G7 over the weekend.

00:03:55.602 --> 00:03:57.804
We started by talking about this

00:03:57.804 --> 00:03:59.072
death, this mysterious death

00:03:59.072 --> 00:04:00.573
on an airplane of the deputy science

00:04:00.573 --> 00:04:03.243
minister, Peter Coutu Franco.

00:04:03.243 --> 00:04:04.944
He was critical of Putin,

00:04:04.944 --> 00:04:07.680
and he recently told a journalist this.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:08.281
He said,

00:04:08.281 --> 00:04:09.182
save yourself

00:04:09.182 --> 00:04:10.316
and your family, leave

00:04:10.316 --> 00:04:11.584
as soon as possible.

00:04:11.584 --> 00:04:13.753
It is no longer possible to leave.

00:04:13.753 --> 00:04:15.421
They take away our passports.

00:04:15.421 --> 00:04:17.423
They are they are all taken hostage.

00:04:17.423 --> 00:04:18.825
Nobody can say anything.

00:04:18.825 --> 00:04:20.426
Otherwise, we are immediately

00:04:20.426 --> 00:04:22.262
crushed like bugs.

00:04:22.262 --> 00:04:24.530
There are these partizan attacks,

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:25.765
these separate, you know,

00:04:25.765 --> 00:04:26.699
these anti

00:04:26.699 --> 00:04:27.300
regime

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:28.735
Putin regime attacks

00:04:28.735 --> 00:04:30.470
carrying out in Russia

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:33.239
and this mysterious death.

00:04:33.706 --> 00:04:35.174
It's just overall, it's fun.

00:04:35.174 --> 00:04:37.377
And I just want to have several.

00:04:37.377 --> 00:04:38.911
By our count, it's been at least

00:04:38.911 --> 00:04:40.380
11 Russian officials.

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:41.948
What does this all

00:04:41.948 --> 00:04:43.416
come together to mean for you?

00:04:43.416 --> 00:04:44.284
Eventually,

00:04:44.284 --> 00:04:46.853
we know that this is not resistance.

00:04:46.886 --> 00:04:50.223
This is basically people who do not agree

00:04:50.223 --> 00:04:50.890
with the war

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:52.325
and Putin has

00:04:52.325 --> 00:04:53.192
silenced

00:04:53.192 --> 00:04:55.862
or they have meant mysterious deaths.

00:04:56.162 --> 00:04:57.330
Many, many of them,

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:58.665
whether they are journalists,

00:04:58.665 --> 00:05:00.300
whether they're officials,

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:01.601
whether they're private,

00:05:01.601 --> 00:05:03.336
private business people.

00:05:03.336 --> 00:05:05.371
And according to this journalist

00:05:05.371 --> 00:05:07.540
who you're quoting on a telegram channel,

00:05:07.907 --> 00:05:10.109
he writes that this individual,

00:05:10.109 --> 00:05:12.345
this deputy minister,

00:05:12.345 --> 00:05:13.913
had urged him to leave,

00:05:13.913 --> 00:05:17.050
had said what we all know that no dissent

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:18.818
is brooked by the Kremlin,

00:05:18.818 --> 00:05:20.286
absolutely none whatsoever.

00:05:20.286 --> 00:05:21.120
We also know

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:23.156
there are divisions about this war,

00:05:23.156 --> 00:05:25.191
but those who oppose it

00:05:25.191 --> 00:05:25.892
anywhere near

00:05:25.892 --> 00:05:27.460
Putin's circle of silence,

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:29.595
they're not allowed to express themselves

00:05:29.829 --> 00:05:30.797
or the press

00:05:30.797 --> 00:05:33.599
anything even remotely on social media.

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:36.803
That's even vague critical or mentions

00:05:36.803 --> 00:05:38.838
anything other than the pro-war

00:05:38.838 --> 00:05:40.807
propaganda is silence.

00:05:40.807 --> 00:05:42.508
And I think that is

00:05:42.508 --> 00:05:43.743
this is this is what's happening.

00:05:43.743 --> 00:05:44.477
We're not sure

00:05:44.477 --> 00:05:46.412
we do not know how this man died.

00:05:46.412 --> 00:05:47.447
And he is

00:05:47.447 --> 00:05:48.781
he by his own account,

00:05:48.781 --> 00:05:50.049
according to this journalist,

00:05:50.049 --> 00:05:52.318
because of his anxiety over this war,

00:05:52.318 --> 00:05:54.020
not only did he leave,

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:54.520
but he said

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:55.021
he took

00:05:55.021 --> 00:05:57.323
handfuls of antidepressants

00:05:57.323 --> 00:05:59.525
and all sorts of of pills.

00:05:59.525 --> 00:06:01.127
So we don't know how he died,

00:06:01.127 --> 00:06:03.062
but it's one of many mysterious.

00:06:03.062 --> 00:06:05.131
There's no doubt that there's dissent

00:06:05.131 --> 00:06:05.932
against Putin,

00:06:05.932 --> 00:06:08.368
although the vast majority are still,

00:06:08.368 --> 00:06:10.069
you know, hostage to his war,

00:06:10.069 --> 00:06:11.604
and if afraid, rightfully

00:06:11.604 --> 00:06:12.638
so, for their lives.

00:06:12.638 --> 00:06:14.607
Christiane Amanpour, thank you very much.

